{"id":"tariffs","title":"Tariffs and trade emergencies","summary":"In 2025 the President imposed tariffs under national emergency declarations. Senators forced votes on resolutions to end those emergencies, including the tariffs on Canada (S.J.Res. 37, which passed the Senate 51\u201348 on April 2, 2025) and global tariffs. To take effect, a resolution would also need to pass the House and be signed by the President (or survive a veto).","updated":"2026-11-07T18:03+00:00","votes":[{"id":"119-1-600","date":"2025-10-30","bill":"S.J.Res. 88","title":"A joint resolution terminating the national emergency declared to impose global tariffs.","question":"On the Joint Resolution","result":"Joint Resolution Passed","counts":{"yeas":"51","nays":"47","present":"","absent":""},"source":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1191/vote_119_1_00600.htm","parties":{"D":{"Y":45,"N":0,"NV":0},"R":{"Y":4,"N":45,"NV":2},"I":{"Y":2,"N":0,"NV":0}},"positions":{"G000386":"N","M000133":"Y","S000148":"Y","W000779":"Y","M000355":"Y","D000563":"Y","B001236":"N","S001150":"Y","C001047":"N","V000128":"Y","B001243":"N","M001169":"Y","H001042":"Y","G000555":"Y","W000800":"Y","C001075":"N","P000595":"Y","H001046":"Y","L000570":"Y","L000571":"N","Y000064":"N","L000575":"N","S001184":"N","C001095":"N","D000622":"Y","D000618":"N","C001096":"N","G000574":"Y","B001299":"N","B001303":"Y","B001305":"N","M001198":"N","R000608":"Y","C001114":"N","K000394":"Y","S001208":"Y","R000122":"Y","S000033":"Y","C000880":"N","W000437":"NV","M000934":"N","T000250":"N","B001230":"Y","C000127":"Y","M001153":"Y","C001056":"N","K000367":"Y","W000802":"Y","B001261":"N","R000584":"N","S001181":"Y","M001176":"Y","W000805":"Y","B001267":"Y","C001088":"Y","B001277":"Y","P000603":"Y","H001061":"N","L000577":"N","J000293":"N","S001194":"Y","K000383":"Y","W000817":"Y","F000463":"N","C001098":"N","K000384":"Y","B001288":"Y","S001198":"N","E000295":"N","T000476":"N","R000605":"N","C001113":"Y","H001076":"Y","K0