duties on articles imported from Canada.","question":"On the Joint Resolution","result":"Joint Resolution Passed","counts":{"yeas":"51","nays":"48","present":"","absent":""},"source":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1191/vote_119_1_00160.htm","parties":{"D":{"Y":45,"N":0,"NV":0},"R":{"Y":4,"N":46,"NV":1},"I":{"Y":2,"N":0,"NV":0}},"positions":{"G000386":"N","M000133":"Y","S000148":"Y","W000779":"Y","M000355":"Y","D000563":"Y","B001236":"N","S001150":"Y","C001047":"N","V000128":"Y","B001243":"N","M001169":"Y","H001042":"Y","G000555":"Y","W000800":"Y","C001075":"N","P000595":"Y","H001046":"Y","L000570":"Y","L000571":"N","Y000064":"N","L000575":"N","S001184":"N","C001095":"N","D000622":"Y","D000618":"N","C001096":"N","G000574":"Y","B001299":"N","B001303":"Y","B001305":"N","M001198":"NV","R000608":"Y","C001114":"N","K000394":"Y","S001208":"Y","R000122":"Y","S000033":"Y","C000880":"N","W000437":"N","M000934":"N","T000250":"N","B001230":"Y","C000127":"Y","M001153":"Y","C001056":"N","K000367":"Y","W000802":"Y","B001261":"N","R000584":"N","S001181":"Y","M001176":"Y","W000805":"Y","B001267":"Y","C001088":"Y","B001277":"Y","P000603":"Y","H001061":"N","L000577":"N","J000293":"N","S001194":"Y","K000383":"Y","W000817":"Y","F000463":"N","C001098":"N","K000384":"Y","B001288":"Y","S001198":"N","E000295":"N","T000476":"N","R000605":"N","C001113":"Y","H001076":"Y","K000393":"N","S001203":"Y","H001079":"N","H001089":"N","S001217":"N","K000377":"Y","H000601":"N","H000273":"Y","T000278":"N","O000174":"Y","P000145":"Y","W000790":"Y","B001319":"N","F000479":"Y","R000618":"N","S001227":"N","A000382":"Y","M001243":"N","M001242":"N","S001232":"N","J000312":"N","H001104":"N","M001244":"N","M001111":"Y","C001035":"Y"}}],"bills":[{"name":"S.J.Res. 37","summary":{"text":"This joint resolution terminates the national emergency declared by President Donald J. Trump on February 1, 2025, which imposed an additional 25% tariff on most imports from Canada (except for Canadian energy or energy resources, which have an additional 10% tariff).","version":"Introduced in Senate","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/senate-joint-resolution/37"}}],"promises":[{"kind":"promise","id":"p-H000273-002","bioguide":"H000273","name":"John W. Hickenlooper","party":"Democrat","state":"CO","quote":"Donald Trump knows the Senate can\u2019t pass a bill to fund the government without 7 Democratic votes. So why is he refusing to negotiate?\n\nI will not be one of those 7 unless we address skyrocketing costs caused by health care cuts and tariffs.","promise":"Said he will not vote for a government funding bill unless it addresses health care costs and tariffs.","status":"kept","verified":false,"source_url":"https://x.com/SenatorHick/status/1970561670859952173","source_date":"2025-09-23","platform":null},{"kind":"promise","id":"p-T000476-001","bioguide":"T000476","name":"Thom Tillis","party":"Republican","state":"NC","quote":"Nope, this story is wrong. I was not talking about the Kaine resolution,\u00a0which I will be voting against. \n\nTariffs must be executed with precision to protect North Carolina farmers and businesses who have been hurt by bad trade policies before, including\u00a0NAFTA.","promise":"Said he will vote against the Kaine resolution on tariffs.","status":"kept","verified":false,"source_url":"https://x.com/SenThomTillis/status/1907084911040766104","source_date":"2025-04-01","platform":null}],"statements":[{"kind":"statement","id":"s-W000790-004","bioguide":"W000790","name":"Raphael G. Warnock","party":"Democrat","state":"GA","quote":"This is a small but meaningful victory for all Americans who continue to suffer under this President's reckless tariffs.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2026/08/07/172/130/modified/CREC-2026-08-07-pt1-PgS4533.htm","source_date":"2026-08-07","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-W000790-005","bioguide":"W000790","name":"Raphael G. Warnock","party":"Democrat","state":"GA","quote":"But we should not have to choose between putting a check on Putin's aggression and putting a check on this President's tariff regime.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2026/08/07/172/130/modified/CREC-2026-08-07-pt1-PgS4533.htm","source_date":"2026-08-07","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-M000355-003","bioguide":"M000355","name":"Mitch McConnell","party":"Republican","state":"KY","quote":"With the 152nd running of the Kentucky Derby this Saturday, the President\u2019s decision to roll back tariffs on bourbon and whiskey is timely and welcome news.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.mcconnell.senate.gov/public/index.cfm/pressreleases?ID=E8C83CDB-AF33-4E16-8E35-E19534265E16","source_date":"2026-04-30","platform":"press release"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-M001169-002","bioguide":"M001169","name":"Christopher Murphy","party":"Democrat","state":"CT","quote":"Seventy percent of farmers right now in this country say that they will not have enough money in order to plant the next crop because the tariffs and the diesel prices are putting many of them out of business.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2026/04/30/172/76/modified/CREC-2026-04-30-pt1-PgS2153-2.htm","source_date":"2026-04-30","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-B001267-001","bioguide":"B001267","name":"Michael F. Bennet","party":"Democrat","state":"CO","quote":"This is a tough economy that we are in today, and tariffs and now gas prices haven't helped.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2026/03/19/172/50/modified/CREC-2026-03-19-pt1-PgS1314.htm","source_date":"2026-03-19","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-C001035-004","bioguide":"C001035","name":"Susan M. Collins","party":"Republican","state":"ME","quote":"Yesterday, I pressed the U.S. Trade Representative on how the tariff on steel and aluminum is driving up costs for Maine\u2019s lobster and blueberry industries, and I urged that these iconic Maine industries be exempted.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://x.com/SenatorCollins/status/1998852993001668924","source_date":"2025-12-10","platform":"X"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-B001267-005","bioguide":"B001267","name":"Michael F. Bennet","party":"Democrat","state":"CO","quote":"President Trump's tariffs, as everybody in this Chamber knows, are driving up grocery prices and costs and the costs to keep our farms running.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/11/04/171/184/modified/CREC-2025-11-04-pt1-PgS7882-4.htm","source_date":"2025-11-04","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-M000133-008","bioguide":"M000133","name":"Edward J. Markey","party":"Democrat","state":"MA","quote":"So back in May, I introduced and tried to pass my Small Business Liberation Act, a bill that would have protected small businesses from Trump's tariff chaos, just saying: Get those 97 percent of all the businesses engaged in trade--the small businesses--get them out of this war.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/10/29/171/180/modified/CREC-2025-10-29-pt1-PgS7811.htm","source_date":"2025-10-29","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-H001042-004","bioguide":"H001042","name":"Mazie K. Hirono","party":"Democrat","state":"HI","quote":"That is why I was proud to join Senator Markey in introducing legislation which he will talk about soon to exempt small businesses from Trump's tariffs, tariffs that may well force many of these businesses to shut down altogether.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/05/21/171/86/modified/CREC-2025-05-21-pt1-PgS3025-3.htm","source_date":"2025-05-21","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-C001035-009","bioguide":"C001035","name":"Susan M. Collins","party":"Republican","state":"ME","quote":"I rise today in support of the resolution introduced by my colleague from Virginia, Senator Kaine, to overturn the emergency declaration for the northern border that is being used to impose tariffs on goods imported from Canada.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/04/02/171/59/modified/CREC-2025-04-02-pt1-PgS2109.htm","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-S001181-006","bioguide":"S001181","name":"Jeanne Shaheen","party":"Democrat","state":"NH","quote":"President, I come to the floor to join my colleagues because I am so concerned about the damaging impact of President Trump's tariff taxes.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/04/02/171/59/modified/CREC-2025-04-02-pt1-PgS2121-3.htm","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-W000805-001","bioguide":"W000805","name":"Mark R. Warner","party":"Democrat","state":"VA","quote":"Mr. President, I rise to join my colleagues who are in support of Senator Kaine's, I think, thoughtful approach on how we can put an end to this tariff war with Canada.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/04/02/171/59/modified/CREC-2025-04-02-pt1-PgS2121-3.htm","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-W000805-003","bioguide":"W000805","name":"Mark R. Warner","party":"Democrat","state":"VA","quote":"So I would hope that folks on both sides of the aisle will actually stand up to ``America First.'' Reject this misguided tariff strategy.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/04/02/171/59/modified/CREC-2025-04-02-pt1-PgS2121-3.htm","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-M001153-008","bioguide":"M001153","name":"Lisa Murkowski","party":"Republican","state":"AK","quote":"Today I voted to terminate the emergency declaration put in place to justify higher tariffs on Canadian imports.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://x.com/lisamurkowski/status/1907582173030326620","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"X"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-B001277-005","bioguide":"B001277","name":"Richard Blumenthal","party":"Democrat","state":"CT","quote":"Careless, cruel, reckless--that is what these tariffs are, particularly as directed to Canada.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/04/02/171/59/modified/CREC-2025-04-02-pt1-PgS2121-3.htm","source_date":"2025-04-02","platform":"floor speech"},{"kind":"statement","id":"s-S001181-003","bioguide":"S001181","name":"Jeanne Shaheen","party":"Democrat","state":"NH","quote":"Madam President, I come to the floor today because I am concerned about President Trump's actions to, I believe, start a trade war with our top two trading partners, Canada and Mexico.","promise":null,"status":null,"verified":false,"source_url":"https://www.congress.gov/119/crec/2025/03/04/171/41/modified/CREC-2025-03-04-pt1-PgS1477-2.htm","source_date":"2025-03-04","platform":"floor speech"}],"lobbying":null}